WEBVTT
NOTE OpenIE Planetary 15s v1.0 — rce (ha) · elevenlabs:eleven_v4_turbo

1
00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:10.257
<v Narrator>A farko, ka rubuta wani shirin a lokaci daya kamar yadda daya bayyananne blueprint, da kwamfuta samar da matching code tsakanin harsuna.

2
00:00:10.337 --> 00:00:20.323
<v Narrator>Na biyu, duk wani shigar da za a iya dole ne ya kasance da sakamakon da aka bayyana a gaba, hana faɗuwa ɓoye kafin komai ya yi tafiya.

3
00:00:20.403 --> 00:00:30.390
<v Narrator>Na uku, duk gyara da ya wuce mai duba an adana shi kuma aka sake amfani da shi, don haka ba za ka iya biya sau biyu ba don gyara ɗaya.
